er": 1, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "0은 유리수이다."}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "모든 자연수는 정수이다."}]}, {"number": 3, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "모든 정수는 유리수이다."}]}, {"number": 4, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "음수끼리는 절댓값이 큰 수가 작다."}]}, {"number": 5, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "정수는 양의 정수와 음의 정수로 이루어졌다."}]}]}, {"number": 5, "score": 3.0, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "다음 중 옳지 않은 것은?"}], "choices": [{"number": 1, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-\\frac{19}{3} < -5"}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-\\frac{1}{2} > -\\frac{2}{5}"}]}, {"number": 3, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "\\left| -\\frac{2}{3} \\right| > \\frac{2}{7}"}]}, {"number": 4, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-10.7 < 5"}]}, {"number": 5, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "\\frac{1}{4} > \\frac{1}{6}"}]}]}, {"number": 6, "score": 4.0, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "다음 중 계산 결과가 옳지 않은 것은?"}], "choices": [{"number": 1, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "\\left( -\\frac{6}{5} \\right) + \\left( +\\frac{7}{5} \\right) = +\\frac{1}{5}"}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "\\left( -\\frac{7}{3} \\right) - \\left( +\\frac{1}{6} \\right) = -\\frac{5}{2}"}]}, {"number": 3, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "\\left( -\\frac{5}{14} \\right) + \\left( -\\frac{1}{7} \\right) = +\\frac{1}{2}"}]}, {"number": 4, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "(-3.8) - (-5.2) = +1.4"}]}, {"number": 5, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "(+3) - (+6) - (-5) = +2"}]}]}, {"number": 7, "score": 3.0, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "\\frac{5}{4} - 7 + \\frac{11}{4}을 계산하면?"}], "choices": [{"number": 1, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-3"}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-2"}]}, {"number": 3, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "+2"}]}, {"number": 4, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "+3"}]}, {"number": 5, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "+4"}]}]}, {"number": 8, "score": 4.0, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "-\\frac{1}{7}의 역수를 a, 0.6의 역수를 b라 할 때, a-b의 값은?"}], "choices": [{"number": 1, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-9"}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-\\frac{26}{3}"}]}, {"number": 3, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-\\frac{25}{3}"}]}, {"number": 4, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-8"}]}, {"number": 5, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-\\frac{23}{3}"}]}]}, {"number": 9, "score": 5.0, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "두 수 a, b에 대하여 b-a<0, a \\div b<0, |a|<|b|일 때, 다음 중 옳지 않은 것은?"}], "choices": [{"number": 1, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "a+b<0"}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-b+a>0"}]}, {"number": 3, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-a-b<0"}]}, {"number": 4, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "|a|-b>0"}]}, {"number": 5, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "|b|-a>0"}]}]}, {"number": 10, "score": 5.0, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "\\frac{5}{8} \\times \\left[ -\\frac{1}{5} + \\left\\{ \\frac{1}{3} + (-3)^{2} \\div \\frac{9}{2} \\right\\} \\right]를 계산하면?"}], "choices": [{"number": 1, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-\\frac{7}{3}"}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-\\frac{5}{3}"}]}, {"number": 3, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-\\frac{4}{3}"}]}, {"number": 4, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "\\frac{4}{3}"}]}, {"number": 5, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "\\frac{5}{3}"}]}]}, {"number": 11, "score": 5.0, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "곱셈 기호 \\times와 나눗셈 기호 \\div를 생략한 식으로 